  "description": "\"Retro\" 960 theme for the WA.Core Blazor UI: the fluid 960 grid system (12 columns, made responsive), its grey-box look, an Aether-compatible kit and the shared FViewer markup; no template JS (only a ~50-line helper for data-bs dropdowns/tabs). Built on SI.WA.UI.Core.",
  "id": "SI.WA.UI.960",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-13T15:25:14.083Z",
