  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.1 -- Grid: per-value cell colours from CustomClass.xml (class / style on the cell); the CSV / Excel export button opens the WA_GridExport wizard. Card: body-key=\"@KEY\" / \"@Field\" shows a 'save first' note while the parent record is new and reloads the body form when the parent gets its key. Requires SI.WA.UI.Core 1.4.0. 1.3.0 -- Grid: filter toggle honours ShowGridFilterPanel; WA_TextBox renders format=\"password\" as a password input. Requires SI.WA.UI.Core 1.3.0. Data Management > Import, with the Sneat markup (linked, like the other Data Management pages). 1.1.0 -- Requires SI.WA.UI.Core 1.1.0 (AI providers and encrypted API keys moved from appsettings.json to the WA_AiSettings table, with priority failover between providers -- see the SI.WA.UI.Core release notes). Data Management: Table Designer, settings.xml designer and table settings dialog markup.",
